HOPE Labs: one launcher for a set of molecular design and simulation tools on a cluster
Copyright (c) 2026, Sandun Fernando, HOPE Lab, Texas A&M University. Authored by Aadhil Haq. All rights reserved.

This software is not open source. No licence to use, copy, modify or
distribute it is granted without written permission from Dr. Sandun Fernando.

It is a launcher: it signs in to a cluster, starts the tools installed there
and draws them as a flow. It implements none of the methods those tools run.
Each tool keeps its own licence and its own notices, and the terms of one of
them reach this launcher: BindCraft2 may not be offered to third parties as a
hosted service.

The third-party programs and libraries it uses keep their own licences; see
THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md.

Contact: Dr. Sandun Fernando (sfernando@tamu.edu), Aadhil Haq (aadhil.haq@tamu.edu).
